 value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids in Montgomery County shows November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years since 1951, more than any other pair. In 2025, on the middle of the grids, Nov-Dec ran 31% of normal while June to July ran 173%. May to June is the wettest pair at 10.76 inches and January to February the driest at 2.89. Grid 20538 had its driest year in 1952 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
